<h1>shadow heap</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="heap.html"><em>heap</em></a>, implemented in an <a href="array.html"><em>array</em></a>, adjacent to an unordered table.  The <em>shadow</em> is the table <a href="node.html"><em>nodes</em></a> and all their (recursive) <a href="parent.html"><em>parents</em></a>, by array index, in the heap.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="shadowmrgins.html"><em>shadow merge insert</em></a>, <a href="shadowmerge.html"><em>shadow merge</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
